I think maybe it's from the line in predict_snpgeno()

     ph <- qtl2::guess_phase(cross, geno, cores=cores)

I'm assuming that the result has 3-d arrays within each chromosome, and then pulling apart the two pieces.

Seems like when I wrote this, I was thinking only of heterozygous populations.

The function seems to need some major revisions.

karl

